    <encodingDesc>
      <projectDesc>
        <p>
          This TEI document encodes a Linked Open Data project about the transformation
          of the Gare d’Orsay into the Musée d’Orsay. It annotates people, places,
          events, concepts, organizations, bibliographic references, digital resources,
          and relations between them.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Gare d’Orsay and the Musée d’Orsay are modeled as distinct historical
          entities. They refer to the same physical structure in different periods and
          with different functions. Therefore, they are connected through an adaptive
          reuse event and are not declared identical with owl:sameAs.
        </p>
      </projectDesc>

